n\n  \n  \n\n  <div id=\"MainContent_pnlArticle\">\n\t\n\n    \n  \n\n    \n    <section class=\"art-hero art-shell\">\n      <div class=\"art-hero-tag\">\n        ✎ General\n      </div>\n      <h1 class=\"art-hero-title\">\n        AI News May 2026 — Every Model Release, Launch and Announcement Tracked Daily\n      </h1>\n      <p class=\"art-hero-excerpt\">\n        GPT-5.5 shipped April 23, Gemini 3.1 Ultra went live with a 2M-token context window, and Microsoft Agent 365 is now generally available. Updated daily throughout May 2026.\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"art-hero-meta\">\n        <span>By AIToolsRecap</span>\n        <span>May 3, 2026</span>\n        <span>6 min read</span>\n        <span>10252 views</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    \n    \n\n    \n    <div class=\"art-breadcrumb\">\n      <a href=\"/\">Home</a>\n      <span class=\"bc-sep\">›</span>\n      <a href=\"/Articles.aspx\">Articles</a>\n       <span class=\"bc-sep\">›</span> <a href=\"/Articles.aspx?category=general\">General</a> <span class=\"bc-sep\">›</span> <span class=\"bc-current\">AI News May 2026 — All Model Releases, Announce...</span>\n    </div>\n\n    \n    <div id=\"mayHubBanner\" style=\"display:none;\">\n      <a href=\"/Blog/MayNews2026\" class=\"may-hub-strip\">\n        <span class=\"may-hub-icon\">📅</span>\n        <span class=\"may-hub-text\">Part of the <strong>May 2026 AI News</strong> daily series</span>\n        <span class=\"may-hub-cta\">View full calendar &amp; all roundups →</span>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n    <style>\n      .may-hub-strip {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        gap: 10px;\n        background: #111;\n        border: 1px solid #2a2a2a;\n        border-left: 3px solid #e53;\n        border-radius: 6px;\n        padding: 10px 16px;\n        margin: 10px 0 0;\n        text-decoration: none;\n        transition: background 0.12s, border-color 0.12s;\n      }\n      .may-hub-strip:hover { background: #161616; border-left-color: #ff6644; }\n      .may-hub-icon { font-size: 15px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n      .may-hub-text { font-size: 13px; color: #888; flex: 1; }\n      .may-hub-text strong { color: #ccc; font-weight: 600; }\n      .may-hub-cta { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #e53; white-space: nowrap; flex-shrink: 0; }\n      .may-hub-strip:hover .may-hub-cta { color: #ff6644; }\n    </style>\n    <script>\n      (function () {\n        var slug = window.location.pathname.toLowerCase();\n        if (/\\/blog\\/ai-news-may-\\d+-2026/.test(slug)) {\n          document.getElementById('mayHubBanner').style.display = 'block';\n        }\n      })();\n    </script>\n\n    \n    <div class=\"art-layout art-shell\">\n\n      <article class=\"art-body\">\n          <div class=\"art-cover\">\n      <img src=\"https://aitoolsrecap.com/ArticleImages/default_article.jpg\" id=\"MainContent_imgArticleCover\" alt=\"AI News May 2026 — Every Model Release, Launch and Announcement Tracked Daily\">\n    </div>\n        <div class=\"art-content-wrap\">\n          <div class=\"quick-answer-box\" style=\"background:#1a1a2e;border-left:4px solid #f59e0b;padding:20px;margin-bottom:30px;border-radius:6px;\">\n<h2 style=\"color:#f59e0b;margin-top:0;\">May 2026 AI News — What Happened This Month</h2>\n<p style=\"color:#e5e7eb;\">GPT-5.5 shipped April 23 with state-of-the-art agentic coding. Gemini 3.1 Ultra launched with a 2-million token context window. Microsoft Agent 365 went generally available. Anthropic's Code with Claude developer conference opened for livestream registration. This page is updated daily throughout May 2026.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2>Latest AI News — May 2026 Daily Digest</h2>\n<p>The AI model release pace in May 2026 has not slowed. OpenAI shipped GPT-5.5 on April 23 — only six weeks after GPT-5.4 — with its strongest agentic coding performance to date: 82.7% on Terminal-Bench 2.0 and 58.6% on SWE-Bench Pro. It rolled out immediately to Plus, Pro, Business, and Enterprise users in ChatGPT and Codex.</p>\n<p>Google's Gemini 3.1 Ultra is the headline infrastructure release of the month. The 2-million token context window operates natively across text, image, audio, and video without transcription intermediaries. A sandboxed Code Execution tool ships alongside it, letting the model write and run code mid-conversation.</p>\n<p>Microsoft Agent 365 became generally available on May 2, extending identity, security, and governance tooling to AI agents across enterprise environments. Meta acquired Assured Robot Intelligence to accelerate its humanoid robotics push. Qwen partnered with Fireworks AI to lower inference costs on its closed-weights models.</p>\n\n<h2>AI News by Date — May 2026</h2>\n<p>Click any date below for the full news digest for that day. Pages are published daily as events are confirmed.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">1-2026\"&gt;May 1, 2026 — OpenAI-Microsoft restructure, OpenAI smartphone rumors, Google search AI Overviews expansion</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">2-2026\"&gt;May 2, 2026 — Microsoft Agent 365 GA, Anthropic Code with Claude conference, Qwen x Fireworks AI partnership</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">3-2026\"&gt;May 3, 2026 — Mistral 128B flagship, GPT-5.5 API rollout update, agentic AI enterprise deployments</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">4-2026\"&gt;May 4, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">5-2026\"&gt;May 5, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">6-2026\"&gt;May 6, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">7-2026\"&gt;May 7, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">8-2026\"&gt;May 8, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">9-2026\"&gt;May 9, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">10-2026\"&gt;May 10, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">11-2026\"&gt;May 11, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">12-2026\"&gt;May 12, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">13-2026\"&gt;May 13, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">14-2026\"&gt;May 14, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">15-2026\"&gt;May 15, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">16-2026\"&gt;May 16, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">17-2026\"&gt;May 17, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">18-2026\"&gt;May 18, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">19-2026\"&gt;May 19, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">20-2026\"&gt;May 20, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">21-2026\"&gt;May 21, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">22-2026\"&gt;May 22, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">23-2026\"&gt;May 23, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">24-2026\"&gt;May 24, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">25-2026\"&gt;May 25, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">26-2026\"&gt;May 26, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">27-2026\"&gt;May 27, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">28-2026\"&gt;May 28, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">29-2026\"&gt;May 29, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">30-2026\"&gt;May 30, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"coming-soon\">31-2026\"&gt;May 31, 2026 — Coming soon</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Key AI Trends to Watch in May 2026</h2>\n<p>Agentic AI has shifted from feature to expectation. Microsoft Agent 365, Cursor's Agents Window, and Claude Code's multi-agent orchestration all shipped in the weeks leading into May. The question is no longer whether an AI tool supports agents — it is how well it governs them.</p>\n<p>Inference cost is collapsing faster than capability is growing. Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite runs at $0.25 per million input tokens. xAI cut agent tool call pricing 50% in April. DeepSeek V4 offers a 1-million token context window at $0.27 per million input tokens. If you are still paying frontier prices for non-frontier tasks, you are overpaying.</p>\n<p>Open-source is no longer second tier. Mistral's 128B flagship, Qwen's closed-weights models on Fireworks AI, and GLM-4.7 trained on Huawei Ascend silicon (at $0.11 per million input tokens, 1.2% hallucination rate) are closing the gap on GPT-5.5 and Claude Opus for many workloads.</p>\n\n<h2>About This Page</h2>\n<p>AIToolsRecap covers AI tool news, model releases, and practical comparisons daily. This hub is updated as news breaks. Bookmark it and check back each day, or follow individual date pages for a focused digest of what happened on a specific day in May 2026.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"art-tags\">\n          <span class=\"art-tags-label\">Tags</span>\n          <div class=\"art-tags-items\">\n            <span class=\"art-tag\">AI News</span><span class=\"art-tag\">Generative AI</span><span class=\"art-tag\">OpenAI</span><span class=\"art-tag\">Anthropic</span><span class=\"art-tag\">Google</span><span class=\"art-tag\">2026</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"art-actions\">\n          <div class=\"art-actions-title\">Share this article</div>\n          <div class=\"art-actions-row\">\n            <a href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=AI%20News%20May%202026%20%E2%80%94%20All%20Model%20Releases%2C%20Announcements%20and%20Launches%20%E2%80%94%20via%20%40AIToolsRecap&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Faitoolsrecap.com%2FBlog%2Fai-news-may-2026\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-solid btn-sm\">𝕏 Share on X</a>\n            <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https%3A%2F%2Faitoolsrecap.com%2FBlog%2Fai-news-